ove robustness and prepare for future enhancements, we need to\nenforce strict argument validation for the \u0027list\u0027 command.\n\nLet\u0027s introduce a \u0027ListCommandParser\u0027 to reject any arguments that are\nnot yet supported.\n\nAlso, let\u0027s update the usage and success messages to refer to \u0027residents\u0027\ninstead of \u0027persons\u0027, contextualising the application for the RACE\ndomain.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":44,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":29,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-03-12T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"fdba79752899780192ff284ada19ae80f32bcb40","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Tests: Improve test coverage for ListCommand","messageBody":"The previous commit introduced an \u0027equals\u0027 method in ListCommand, but the existing tests did not cover all of its branches.\n\nThis resulted in a Codecov patch coverage failure.\n\nLet\u0027s add a dedicated unit test for the \u0027equals\u0027 method in \u0027ListCommandTest\u0027 to ensure all branches are executed, increasing coverage and satisfying the CI check.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":20,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-03-17T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"b9a9c2f5c206fe6ff62a4c067c1f40bd5987702a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #111 from aishgogoyal/branch-MoreRoomValidation","messageBody":"Update room validation to accept 2 digits and optional letter ","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"aishgogoyal":[{"date":"2026-03-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"74a09085e1dcacdfcce96803d1c74208ae422536","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update aish aboutme","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"21af9a5e33095cb638a6d1c2aa5a8708d7ffe39b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #37 from aishgogoyal/branch-AishPhoto","messageBody":"Add aish photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}